Description: Migrate libidn12 dependency to libidn2-0 with full SASLprep support
 Replace libidn (libidn12) with libidn2-0, preserving all original
 functionality with no new runtime dependencies:
 .
 - Build system: change libidn-dev to libidn2-dev, detect libidn2 via
   pkg-config and AC_CHECK_LIB, define HAVE_LIBIDN2, check for idn2.h
 - locale_to_utf8: replace removed stringprep_locale_to_utf8() with
   iconv (glibc), matching the original internal implementation
 - SASLprep: implement RFC 4013 in pdf_saslprep.c using libunistring
   (already a transitive dependency of libidn2-0) for NFKC normalization,
   Unicode category checks, case folding, and bidi class queries
 - pdf_sec.c: restore apply_sasl() wrapper calling pdf_saslprep()
 - Reference: libidn source RFC 3454 table data (LGPL-3+/GPL-2+,
   compatible with AGPL-3)
Author: liuli <liuli@uniontech.com>
Last-Update: 2026-11-26

